Aim: To perform arithmetic operations using a user-defined package.

Algorithm:
1. Create a package.
2. Create a class with arithmetic methods.
3. Import the package.
4. Create an object.
5. Call the methods.
6. Display the results

File 1: Calc.java
package mypack;

public class Calc {
    public void add(int a,int b) {
        System.out.println(a+b);
    }
}

File 2: Main.java
import mypack.Calc;

class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Calc c=new Calc();
        c.add(10,20);
    }
}
